<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal denies plan to hike fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Portugal denies plan to hike fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Economy Minister Augusto Mateus said fuel prices would not rise in Portugal, denying press reports that prices could rise by two escudos per litre.</p>
<p>&quot;Nothing is in preparation in terms of an increase in fuel prices,&quot; Mateus told reporters.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
